# Error tracking — Sentry

Required env: `SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN`, `SENTRY_ORG`, `SENTRY_PROJECT`.

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=sentry -->

- Recent issues → `mcp__sentry__listIssues` (filter by status, environment, time range)
- Issue detail → `mcp__sentry__getIssue`
- Release → `mcp__sentry__createRelease` + `setCommits`

